",{"withheld":1,"src":"https://dedigital.dde.pr/pluginfile.php/145102/mod_resource/content/6/Est%C3%A1ndares%20y%20Expectativas%20Programa%20de%20Ingl%C3%A9s.pdf"}],[0,"2.W.6.1a","","indicator","Writing",{"withheld":1,"src":"https://dedigital.dde.pr/pluginfile.php/145102/mod_resource/content/6/Est%C3%A1ndares%20y%20Expectativas%20Programa%20de%20Ingl%C3%A9s.pdf"}],[0,"2.W.7","","standard","Writing",{"withheld":1,"src":"https://dedigital.dde.pr/pluginfile.php/145102/mod_resource/content/6/Est%C3%A1ndares%20y%20Expectativas%20Programa%20de%20Ingl%C3%A9s.pdf"}],[0,"2.W.7.1","","expectation","Writing",{"withheld":1,"src":"https://dedigital.dde.pr/pluginfile.php/145102/mod_resource/content/6/Est%C3%A1ndares%20y%20Expectativas%20Programa%20de%20Ingl%C3%A9s.pdf"}],[0,"2.W.8","","standard","Writing",{"withheld":1,"src":"https://dedigital.dde.pr/pluginfile.php/145102/mod_resource/content/6/Est%C3%A1ndares%20y%20Expectativas%20Programa%20de%20Ingl%C3%A9s.pdf"}],[0,"2.W.8.1","","expectation","Writing",{"withheld":1,"src":"https://dedigital.dde.pr/pluginfile.php/145102/mod_resource/content/6/Est%C3%A1ndares%20y%20Expectativas%20Programa%20de%20Ingl%C3%A9s.pdf"}],[0,"2.W.8.1a","","indicator","Writing",{"withheld":1,"src":"https://dedigital.dde.pr/pluginfile.php/145102/mod_resource/content/6/Est%C3%A1ndares%20y%20Expectativas%20Programa%20de%20Ingl%C3%A9s.pdf"}],[1,"128.4(b)(1)(A)","listen actively, ask relevant questions to clarify information, and answer questions using multi-word responses;","expectation","1",null],[1,"128.4(b)(1)(B)","follow, restate, and give oral instructions that involve a short, related sequence of actions;","expectation","1",null],[1,"128.4(b)(1)(C)","share information and ideas that focus on the topic under discussion, speaking clearly at an appropriate pace and using the conventions of language;","expectation","1",null],[1,"128.4(b)(1)(D)","work collaboratively with others by following agreed-upon rules for discussion, including listening to others, speaking when recognized, making appropriate contributions, and building on the ideas of others; and","expectation","1",null],[1,"128.4(b)(1)(E)","develop social communication such as distinguishing between asking and telling.","expectation","1",null],[1,"128.4(b)(2)(A)","demonstrate and apply phonetic knowledge by: (i) decoding multisyllabic words; (ii) decoding words with multiple sound spelling patterns such as c, k, and q and s, z, soft c, and x; (iii) decoding words with silent h and words that use the syllables que-, qui-, gue-, gui-, güe-, and güi-; (iv) decoding words with diphthongs and hiatus; (v) decoding common abbreviations; and (vi) decoding words with prefixes and suffixes;","expectation","2",null],[1,"128.4(b)(2)(B)","demonstrate and apply spelling knowledge by: (i) spelling multisyllabic words; (ii) spelling words with diphthongs and hiatus; (iii) spelling common abbreviations; (iv) spelling words with prefixes and suffixes; and (v) spelling words with silent h and words that use the syllables que-, qui-, gue-, gui-, güe-, and güi-;","expectation","2",null],[1,"128.4(b)(2)(C)","alphabetize a series of words and use a dictionary or glossary to find words; and","expectation","2",null],[1,"128.4(b)(2)(D)","develop handwriting by accurately forming all cursive letters using appropriate strokes when connecting letters.","expectation","2",null],[1,"128.4(b)(3)(A)","use print or digital resources to determine meaning and pronunciation of unknown words;","expectation","3",null],[1,"128.4(b)(3)(B)","use context within and beyond a sentence to determine the meaning of unfamiliar words;","expectation","3",null],[1,"128.4(b)(3)(C)","use affixes, including re-, pre-, -ción, and ísimo/ísima, to determine the meaning of words and subsequently use the newly acquired words;","expectation","3",null],[1,"128.4(b)(3)(D)","identify, use, and explain the meaning of antonyms, synonyms, idioms, and homographs in context; and","expectation","3",null],[1,"128.4(b)(3)(E)","differentiate between and use homographs, homophones, and commonly confused terms such as porque/porqué/por qué/por que, sino/si no, and también/tan bien.","expectation","3",null],[1,"128.4(b)(4)","Developing and sustaining foundational language skills: listening, speaking, reading, writing, and thinking--fluency. The student reads grade-level text with fluency and comprehension. The student is expected to use appropriate fluency (rate, accuracy, and prosody) when reading grade-level text.","strand","4",null],[1,"128.4(b)(5)","Developing and sustaining foundational language skills: listening, speaking, reading, writing, and thinking--self-sustained reading. The student reads grade appropriate texts independently. The student is expected to self-select text and read independently for a sustained period of time.","strand","5",null],[1,"128.4(b)(6)(A)","establish purpose for reading assigned and self-selected texts;","expectation","6",null],[1,"128.4(b)(6)(B)","generate questions about text before, during, and after reading to deepen understanding and gain information;","expectation","6",null],[1,"128.4(b)(6)(C)","make and correct or confirm predictions using text features, characteristics of genre, and structures;","expectation","6",null],[1,"128.4(b)(6)(D)","create mental images to deepen understanding;","expectation","6",null],[1,"128.4(b)(6)(E)","make connections to personal experiences, ideas in other texts, and society;","expectation","6",null],[1,"128.4(b)(6)(F)","make inferences and use evidence to support understanding;","expectation","6",null],[1,"128.4(b)(6)(G)","evaluate details read to determine key ideas;","expectation","6",null],[1,"128.4(b)(6)(H)","synthesize information to create new understanding; and","expectation","6",null],[1,"128.4(b)(6)(I)","monitor comprehension and make adjustments such as re-reading, using background knowledge, checking for visual cues, and asking questions when understanding breaks down.","expectation","6",null],[1,"128.4(b)(7)(A)","describe personal connections to a variety of sources;","expectation","7",null],[1,"128.4(b)(7)(B)","write brief comments on literary or informational texts that demonstrate an understanding of the text;","expectation","7",null],[1,"128.4(b)(7)(C)","use text evidence to support an appropriate response;","expectation","7",null],[1,"128.4(b)(7)(D)","retell and paraphrase texts in ways that maintain meaning and logical order;","expectation","7",null],[1,"128.4(b)(7)(E)","interact with sources in meaningful ways such as illustrating or writing; and","expectation","7",null],[1,"128.4(b)(7)(F)","respond using newly acquired vocabulary as appropriate.","expectation","7",null],[1,"128.4(b)(8)(A)","discuss topics and determine theme using text evidence with adult assistance;","expectation","8",null],[1,"128.4(b)(8)(B)","describe the main character's (characters') internal and external traits;","expectation","8",null],[1,"128.4(b)(8)(C)","describe and understand plot elements, including the main events, the conflict, and the resolution, for texts read aloud and independently; and","expectation","8",null],[1,"128.4(b)(8)(D)","describe the importance of the setting.","expectation","8",null],[1,"128.4(b)(9)(A)","demonstrate knowledge of distinguishing characteristics of well-known children's literature such as folktales, fables, and fairy tales;","expectation","9",null],[1,"128.4(b)(9)(B)","explain visual patterns and structures in a variety of poems;","expectation","9",null],[1,"128.4(b)(9)(C)","discuss elements of drama such as characters, dialogue, and setting;","expectation","9",null],[1,"128.4(b)(9)(D)","recognize characteristics and structures of informational text, including: (i) the central idea and supporting evidence with adult assistance; (ii) features and graphics to locate and gain information; and (iii) organizational patterns such as chronological order and cause and effect stated explicitly;","expectation","9",null],[1,"128.4(b)(9)(E)","recognize characteristics of persuasive text, including: (i) stating what the author is trying to persuade the reader to think or do; and (ii) distinguishing facts from opinion; and","expectation","9",null],[1,"128.4(b)(9)(F)","recognize characteristics of multimodal and digital texts.","expectation","9",null],[1,"128.4(b)(10)(A)","discuss the author's purpose for writing text;","expectation","10",null],[1,"128.4(b)(10)(B)","discuss how the use of text structure contributes to the author's purpose;","expectation","10",null],[1,"128.4(b)(10)(C)","discuss the author's use of print and graphic features to achieve specific purposes;","expectation","10",null],[1,"128.4(b)(10)(D)","discuss the use of descriptive, literal, and figurative language;","expectation","10",null],[1,"128.4(b)(10)(E)","identify the use of first or third person in a text; and","expectation","10",null],[1,"128.4(b)(10)(F)","identify and explain the use of repetition.","expectation","10",null],[1,"128.4(b)(11)(A)","plan a first draft by generating ideas for writing such as drawing and brainstorming;","expectation","11",null],[1,"128.4(b)(11)(B)","develop drafts into a focused piece of writing by: (i) organizing with structure; and (ii) developing an idea with specific and relevant details;","expectation","11",null],[1,"128.4(b)(11)(C)","revise drafts by adding, deleting, or rearranging words, phrases, or sentences;","expectation","11",null],[1,"128.4(b)(11)(D)","edit drafts using standard Spanish conventions, including: (i) complete sentences with subject-verb agreement; (ii) past, present, and future verb tense, including the difference between ser and estar; (iii) singular, plural, common, and proper nouns, including gender-specific articles; (iv) adjectives, including articles; (v) adverbs that convey time and adverbs that convey place; (vi) prepositions and prepositional phrases; (vii) pronouns, including personal, possessive, and objective, and the difference in the use of formal pronoun usted and informal pronoun tú; (viii) coordinating conjunctions to form compound subjects and predicates; (ix) capitalization of proper nouns and the salutation and closing of a letter; (x) punctuation marks at the end of declarative sentences and the beginning and end of exclamatory and interrogative sentences; and (xi) correct spelling of words with grade-appropriate orthographic patterns and rules; and","expectation","11",null],[1,"128.4(b)(11)(E)","publish and share writing.","expectation","11",null],[1,"128.4(b)(12)(A)","compose literary texts, including personal narratives and poetry;","expectation","12",null],[1,"128.4(b)(12)(B)","compose informational texts, including procedural texts and reports; and","expectation","12",null],[1,"128.4(b)(12)(C)","compose correspondence such as thank you notes or letters.","expectation","12",null],[1,"128.4(b)(13)(A)","generate questions for formal and informal inquiry with adult assistance;","expectation","13",null],[1,"128.4(b)(13)(B)","develop and follow a research plan with adult assistance;","expectation","13",null],[1,"128.4(b)(13)(C)","identify and gather relevant sources and information to answer the questions;","expectation","13",null],[1,"128.4(b)(13)(D)","identify primary and secondary sources;","expectation","13",null],[1,"128.4(b)(13)(E)","demonstrate understanding of information gathered;","expectation","13",null],[1,"128.4(b)(13)(F)","cite sources appropriately; and","expectation","13",null],[1,"128.4(b)(13)(G)","use an appropriate mode of delivery, whether written, oral, or multimodal, to present results.","expectation","13",null]]}